# Build output and caches — COPY . . otherwise ships hundreds of MB of bin/obj into the build context
# and bakes the .git history into an image layer.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
.git/
.github/
.gitlab-ci.yml
**/.DS_Store

# Local state and secrets that must never reach an image. Note these are deliberately specific: the
# repository's Data folders also hold EF migrations (source code), and wwwroot/docs holds the
# documentation the app itself serves — neither may be excluded.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/*.user
**/app_db.sqlite
**/app_db.sqlite-shm
**/app_db.sqlite-wal
**/dp-keys/
**/Data/recordings/
capture/

# Reference material that is not part of the runtime payload.
Spec/
docs/
Readme.md
CHANGELOG.md
